+<h1 id="Seurat-tSNE-Functions-for-Integrated-Analysis-Using-Harmony-Results">Seurat tSNE Functions for Integrated Analysis Using Harmony Results<a class="anchor-link" href="#Seurat-tSNE-Functions-for-Integrated-Analysis-Using-Harmony-Results">&#182;</a></h1><p>Similar to the linked vigenette, the harmony results can be used for integrated analysis. You simply replace the CCA dimensional reduction with Harmony.</p>
+
+</div>
+</div>
+</div>
+<div class="cell border-box-sizing code_cell rendered">
+<div class="input">
+<div class="prompt input_prompt">In&nbsp;[9]:</div>
+<div class="inner_cell">
+    <div class="input_area">
+<div class=" highlight hl-r"><pre><span></span><span class="nf">system.time</span><span class="p">({</span>
+<span class="n">pbmc</span> <span class="o">%&lt;&gt;%</span> <span class="nf">RunTSNE</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reduction.use</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">&quot;harmony&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">dims.use</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="m">1</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="m">20</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">do.fast</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="bp">T</span><span class="p">)</span>
+<span class="n">pbmc</span> <span class="o">%&lt;&gt;%</span> <span class="nf">FindClusters</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reduction.type</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">&quot;harmony&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">resolution</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="m">0.6</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">dims.use</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="m">1</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="m">20</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">force.recalc</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="kc">TRUE</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">print.output</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="kc">FALSE</span><span class="p">)</span>
+<span class="p">})</span>
+</pre></div>
+
+    </div>
+</div>
+</div>
+
+<div class="output_wrapper">
+<div class="output">
