+<h2 id="Downstream-analysis">Downstream analysis<a class="anchor-link" href="#Downstream-analysis">&#182;</a></h2><p>Many downstream analyses are performed on low dimensional embeddings, not gene expression. To use the corrected Harmony embeddings rather than PCs, set <em>reduction = 'harmony'</em>. For example, let's perform the UMAP and Nearest Neighbor analyses using the Harmony embeddings.</p>
+
+</div>
+</div>
+</div>
+<div class="cell border-box-sizing code_cell rendered">
+<div class="input">
+<div class="prompt input_prompt">In&nbsp;[110]:</div>
+<div class="inner_cell">
+    <div class="input_area">
+<div class=" highlight hl-r"><pre><span></span><span class="n">pbmc</span> <span class="o">&lt;-</span> <span class="n">pbmc</span> <span class="o">%&gt;%</span> 
+    <span class="nf">RunUMAP</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reduction</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">&quot;harmony&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">dims</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="m">1</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="m">20</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">%&gt;%</span> 
+    <span class="nf">FindNeighbors</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reduction</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">&quot;harmony&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">dims</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="m">1</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="m">20</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">%&gt;%</span> 
+    <span class="nf">FindClusters</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">resolution</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="m">0.5</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">%&gt;%</span> 
+    <span class="nf">identity</span><span class="p">()</span>
+</pre></div>
+
+    </div>
+</div>
+</div>
